  "content": "Recall being upside down and flying through the air. Landed in a ditch. I felt nothing as if my mind and body were separated. Found myself in a white clouded tunnel with a bright white light at the end. I was enjoying the experience so much that I became angry when people on the scene offered emergency assistance. I wanted to be left alone. Recall someone asking if I were dead. I said no I wasn't dead. At that point, I lost the tunnel. The rest is history. I am still here.",
